{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607440/extras/f0c8e4871530aee4d8d14e495cc788f4.poster.avif?t=1768907633\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607440/extras/f0c8e4871530aee4d8d14e495cc788f4.webm?t=1768907633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607440/extras/f0c8e4871530aee4d8d14e495cc788f4.mp4?t=1768907633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Betrayal in Uzovnica</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been framed. Now, there\u2019s no turning back. As a highly trained unit stranded in enemy territory, it\u2019s imperative to push over your limit and get out of there ALIVE. Check every corner and stay alert, because there is nobody that can watch your six.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bodycam Psychological Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bodycam is still recording, capturing every moment of your assignment. From the mundane... to the supernatural. A.A.U. Black Site combines realistic visuals, found-footage aesthetics designed to deliver an immersive journey through multiple levels. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >20+ Weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an array of over 20 weapons, including but not limited to assault rifles, sub-machine guns and pistols. Go tactical or go loud; the choice of loadout is yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upcoming Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The initial release includes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- God\u2019s Chosen (a Demon) - available at launch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Guilt Trip - available at launch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Future scenes will be released over the coming months:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Beneath the Rotten Sky - coming soon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Clean Cut</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Together They Fall</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Absolution Denied<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607440/extras/3767866d0984f7ddb1cc8308c7f194f0.poster.avif?t=1768907633\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607440/extras/3767866d0984f7ddb1cc8308c7f194f0.webm?t=1768907633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3607440?t=1768907633","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607440/0e1ca18c0c462f183746f85488e3513331176d09/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768907633","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607440/b7ad36d4fc9c81bdf1c7e70f62f24dd8645a6ce4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768907633","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607440/b7ad36d4fc9c81bdf1c7e70f62f24dd8645a6ce4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768907633","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"A.A.U. includes violence throughout the game."},"demos":[{"appid":4211190,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607440/extras/f0c8e4871530aee4d8d14e495cc788f4.poster.avif?t=1768907633\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item